OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Sheriff of Nottingham faces
OL,4,Aconduct investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Sheriff of Nottingham will
OL,7,Fface a hearing next month after an
OL,8,Finvestigation into his conduct in
OL,9,Foffice.
OL,11,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,12,F(LDRS) said allegations against
OL,13,Fcouncillor Zafran Khan's had led to an
OL,14,Finvestigation being opened earlier this
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
