OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Sheriff of Nottingham faces
OL,4,Aconduct investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to Nottingham City Council's
OL,7,Frecords, a "misuse of position"
OL,8,Fcomplaint was first received on 18
OL,9,FSeptember last year, and an email was
OL,10,Fsent to councillors stating a standards
OL,11,Fhearing will be held on 15 October,
OL,12,Fwith training for members taking place
OL,13,Fbeforehand on 2 October.
OL,15,FIt is understood Khan denies any
OL,16,Fwrongdoing, but the LDRS said he had
OL,17,Fdeclined to comment.
